agent systems"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Do not recommend an extinguisher solely from memory of fire-class labels; workplace fire protection should follow the applicable current standards and site-specific fire-risk assessment."}]},{"heading":"Industrial process safety","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For chemical/process industries, study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Process hazards"},{"text":"Pressure systems"},{"text":"Temperature hazards"},{"text":"Flammable materials"},{"text":"Toxic releases"},{"text":"Chemical reactions"},{"text":"Storage tanks"},{"text":"Pipelines"},{"text":"Relief systems"},{"text":"Explosion hazards"},{"text":"Dust explosions"},{"text":"Process isolation"},{"text":"Emergency shutdown"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced techniques"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the principles of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"HAZOP"},{"text":"LOPA"},{"text":"FMEA"},{"text":"Bow-tie analysis"},{"text":"Fault Tree Analysis"},{"text":"Event Tree Analysis"},{"text":"Consequence analysis"}]}]},{"heading":"Electrical safety","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Earthing"},{"text":"Electrical isolation"},{"text":"Circuit protection"},{"text":"Short circuits"},{"text":"Overcurrent"},{"text":"Electrical panels"},{"text":"Arc-flash concepts"},{"text":"Static electricity"},{"text":"Hazardous-area concepts"},{"text":"Lockout/Tagout"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For a Safety Auditor, the objective is not to become an electrical engineer."},{"type":"p","text":"The objective is to identify:"},{"type":"flow","items":["What could go wrong","how severe it could be","whether the controls are adequate"]}]},{"heading":"Mechanical and machine safety","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Machine guarding"},{"text":"Interlocks"},{"text":"Emergency stops"},{"text":"Rotating equipment"},{"text":"Conveyors"},{"text":"Presses"},{"text":"Cutting machinery"},{"text":"Lifting equipment"},{"text":"Cranes"},{"text":"Forklifts"},{"text":"Pressure vessels"},{"text":"Confined spaces"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Audit:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Guarding","Access","Isolation","Maintenance","Operator training","Emergency controls"]}]},{"heading":"Construction safety","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is a useful alternative career path."},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Working at height"},{"text":"Scaffolding"},{"text":"Excavation"},{"text":"Lifting operations"},{"text":"Cranes"},{"text":"Temporary electrical systems"},{"text":"Demolition"},{"text":"Confined spaces"},{"text":"Hot work"},{"text":"Traffic management"},{"text":"Fall protection"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential roles:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Construction Safety Officer","HSE Engineer/Executive","Safety Auditor","HSE Manager"]}]},{"heading":"Confined-space safety","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Confined-space identification"},{"text":"Atmospheric testing"},{"text":"Oxygen deficiency"},{"text":"Toxic gases"},{"text":"Flammable gases"},{"text":"Ventilation"},{"text":"Isolation"},{"text":"Entry permits"},{"text":"Rescue plans"},{"text":"Standby personnel"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Never treat confined-space work as ordinary workplace access."}]},{"heading":"Permit-to-work systems","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Hot-work permit"},{"text":"Confined-space permit"},{"text":"Work-at-height permit"},{"text":"Electrical isolation"},{"text":"Excavation permit"},{"text":"Line-breaking permit"},{"text":"Cold-work permit"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A Safety Auditor should verify:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Permit","Risk assessment","Controls","Authorisation","Work","Closure"]}]},{"heading":"Safety management systems","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn the components of an HSE management system:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Safety policy"},{"text":"Objectives"},{"text":"Roles and responsibilities"},{"text":"Risk assessment"},{"text":"Operational controls"},{"text":"Training"},{"text":"Emergency preparedness"},{"text":"Incident reporting"},{"text":"Audits"},{"text":"Corrective actions"},{"text":"Management review"},{"text":"Continuous improvement"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Become familiar with the concepts behind:"},{"type":"h","text":"ISO 45001 — Occupational Health & Safety Management Systems"},{"type":"p","text":"Also understand the relationship between:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Policy","Planning","Implementation","Monitoring","Corrective Action","Improvement"]}]},{"heading":"Environmental and integrated HSE awareness","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A modern safety professional should have basic knowledge of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Waste management"},{"text":"Hazardous waste"},{"text":"Water pollution"},{"text":"Air emissions"},{"text":"Chemical storage"},{"text":"Spill response"},{"text":"Environmental incidents"},{"text":"Emergency response"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the integrated concept:"},{"type":"flow","items":["HSE = Health","Safety","Environment"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Safety auditing","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is the target-role skill."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the complete audit lifecycle:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Plan","Prepare","Inspect","Interview","Collect evidence","Identify nonconformities","Classify findings","Report","Corrective action","Follow-up","Close"]},{"type":"h","text":"Audit preparation"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to review:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Previous audit findings"},{"text":"Incident records"},{"text":"Risk assessments"},{"text":"SOPs"},{"text":"Training records"},{"text":"Inspection records"},{"text":"Maintenance records"},{"text":"Emergency plans"},{"text":"Legal requirements"}]},{"type":"h","text":"During the audit"},{"type":"p","text":"Collect objective evidence."},{"type"