siness continuity"}]}]},{"heading":"Safety technology","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn awareness of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"IoT safety sensors"},{"text":"Gas detection"},{"text":"Wearable safety devices"},{"text":"Digital permit-to-work"},{"text":"Computerised maintenance systems"},{"text":"CCTV analytics"},{"text":"AI-based unsafe-condition detection"},{"text":"Environmental monitoring"},{"text":"Digital HSE management systems"},{"text":"Mobile inspection applications"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Future safety professionals will increasingly work with real-time safety data."}]},{"heading":"Specialisation options","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Lane","Core stack","Best for","Senior direction"],"rows":[[{"text":"Industrial Safety"},{"text":"HIRA + audits + workplace safety"},{"text":"Manufacturing"},{"text":"HSE Manager"}],[{"text":"Fire Safety"},{"text":"Fire protection + emergency response"},{"text":"Facilities/industry"},{"text":"Fire Safety Manager"}],[{"text":"Process Safety"},{"text":"HAZOP + LOPA + process hazards"},{"text":"Chemical/process industry"},{"text":"Process Safety Specialist"}],[{"text":"Construction Safety"},{"text":"Work-at-height + lifting + excavation"},{"text":"Infrastructure"},{"text":"Construction HSE Manager"}],[{"text":"Chemical Safety"},{"text":"Chemical hazards + process safety"},{"text":"Chemical/pharma"},{"text":"Chemical Safety Specialist"}],[{"text":"Electrical Safety"},{"text":"Electrical hazards + isolation"},{"text":"Industrial plants"},{"text":"Electrical Safety Specialist"}],[{"text":"Environmental HSE"},{"text":"Safety + environmental compliance"},{"text":"Industry"},{"text":"HSE/Environmental Manager"}],[{"text":"Safety Auditing"},{"text":"Auditing + standards + risk"},{"text":"Consulting/corporate"},{"text":"Lead HSE Auditor"}],[{"text":"Occupational Health & Safety"},{"text":"Workplace health + risk"},{"text":"Large organisations"},{"text":"OHS Manager"}],[{"text":"Safety Analytics"},{"text":"HSE + data + dashboards"},{"text":"Digital HSE"},{"text":"HSE Analytics Specialist"}]]}]},{"heading":"Portfolio projects","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Factory safety audit"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a mock audit of a manufacturing facility."},{"type":"p","text":"Evaluate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Fire exits"},{"text":"PPE"},{"text":"Machine guarding"},{"text":"Electrical safety"},{"text":"Chemical storage"},{"text":"Emergency preparedness"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Produce an audit report."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — HIRA"},{"type":"p","text":"Select a manufacturing process."},{"type":"p","text":"Prepare:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Hazard","Risk","Existing Control","Risk Rating","Recommended Control"]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Fire-risk assessment"},{"type":"p","text":"Assess a hypothetical industrial facility."},{"type":"p","text":"Map:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Fire loads"},{"text":"Ignition sources"},{"text":"Exits"},{"text":"Fire equipment"},{"text":"Emergency routes"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — HAZOP case study"},{"type":"p","text":"Take a simplified process node and identify:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Deviation"},{"text":"Cause"},{"text":"Consequence"},{"text":"Existing safeguards"},{"text":"Recommendation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Incident investigation"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse a simulated workplace accident using:"},{"type":"flow","items":["5 Whys","Fishbone","Root Cause","Corrective Action"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 6 — Digital HSE dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a Power BI/Excel dashboard containing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Near misses"},{"text":"Incidents"},{"text":"Lost-time injuries"},{"text":"Audit findings"},{"text":"Corrective actions"},{"text":"Training completion"},{"text":"Safety observations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Four-year honours variant"},{"type":"p","text":"For a 4-year Honours/Honours with Research programm